      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOO FAST (2) has been freshened since being safely held on debut at Gosford over 388m (23.08). This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. SCREAMING IMAGE (5) showed good early burn and was there until turning but swamped late to finish 8th at this track in Maiden company. In the mix. HUNKY DORY (7) shows ability but remains a maiden after six starts. Was below best latest when fourth (23.52) at this track but did hit the frame the start prior. The form out of his last race has been franked. Key player if finds best. BOOM BOOM BAM (8) was out of the money here on debut but expected to be much improved.",
